s[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Complete bob-cli-k3.2 with album and record recognition, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]album-local schema diagnostics, a vault-aware registry with [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]album-wins transition semantics, and read-only bob albums [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]list/check reports. Preserve current config-based records behavior [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]until the parent epic's consumer migration and retirement.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]album_model.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/album_model.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/album_and_record_notes.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-k3.2.1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-k3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-k3.2.1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Parse album declarations through shared record schema [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]validation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]album-schema[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]album-schema: add album/record type predicates and the album declaration[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]model; refactor record schema helpers around source-aware diagnostics; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parse top-level album facts and the ordered record mapping with precise [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]file/line/key paths, retaining claims when validation fails. Preserve [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]config parser behavior and cover the local schema rules in unit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Discover album claims, isolate failures, and integrate the [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]vault snapshot[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]album-registry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after album-schema[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]album-registry: implement full discovery and bounded route resolution, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source-tagged RecordType results, album-wins config fallback, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cross-album conflicts, owner/root findings, and structural recognition [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in the notebook snapshot. Keep invalid albums and their records visible [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and expose schema diagnostics without disabling unrelated albums or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notebook catalogs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ship albums list/check with complete reports, completion, and [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]docs[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]album-reports[dim] · [dim][/dim]after album-registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]album-reports: build deterministic schema-version-1 reports from the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry and per-folder RecordCatalog; add albums list/check and bare [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list routing, root filtering, colored human output, command catalog and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion integration, contract tests, and generated documentation.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-k3.2.1","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-k3.2.1.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7a337ae0625842a1d0b4d9a8306f3db3","started_at":"2026-11-11T10:08:07.546818+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"22f83e2b555f0839116167a8a1fac0ec09ad968